## 📘 Overview

This assignment implements a Sudoku solution validator written in C.  
The program reads a Sudoku grid from a text file and checks whether the solution is valid, using synchronization techniques discussed in Operating Systems.

---

##  Files Included

- **mssv.c** – C program that validates the Sudoku solution  
- **solution.txt** – Sample Sudoku solution input file  


